  "notes": "{剃|そ}る means to shave hair off using a razor.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦ひげ→ひげ：01332_hige⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剃|そ}る\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦ひげ→ひげ：01332_hige⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剃|そ}る: to shave one's beard\n- ⟦{頭|あたま}→頭：00574_atama⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{剃|そ}る: to shave one's head\n- ⟦{剃|そ}り{残|のこ}し→剃り残し：noentry⟧: missed spot when shaving\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦かみそり→かみそり：10120_kamisori⟧: razor\n- ⟦{電気|でんき}→電気：09780_denki⟧⟦かみそり→かみそり：10120_kamisori⟧: electric shaver\n- ⟦ひげ{剃|そ}り→髭剃り：22892_higesori⟧: shaving, razor\n\nNOTE: This verb is pronounced そる. Don't confuse with ⟦{反|そ}る→反る：11967_soru⟧ (to bend/warp) which has the same reading.",
